WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.050
Ryu jumps toward Ken at the demonstrated spacing.

2
00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:01.700
Heavy Shoryuken intercepts the airborne Ryu.

3
00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:02.300
Ryu is knocked away by the anti-air Shoryuken.

4
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:02.600
Ken recovers after the anti-air.
